<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 A governance and licensing recipe for cities ‣ Prompt Commons: Collective Prompting as Governance for Urban AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Moderation &amp; “prompt strikes”</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Prompt Commons: Collective Prompting as Governance for Urban AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Risks and mitigations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 7 Risks and mitigations ‣ Prompt Commons: Collective Prompting as Governance for Urban AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dominance capture.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 7 Risks and mitigations ‣ Prompt Commons: Collective Prompting as Governance for Urban AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Security &amp; prompt injection.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 7 Risks and mitigations ‣ Prompt Commons: Collective Prompting as Governance for Urban AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Over-caution.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
