<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Reproducibility details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Files.</h4>

</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Keyword statistics.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the human set vs. augmented set:
mean word count (22.6 vs. 31.7),
vocabulary entropy (7.53 vs. 8.39 bits),
and top keywords (human: <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">street</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">park</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">trees</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">water</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">benches</em>; augmented: <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">street</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">park</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">trees</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">downtown</em>, <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.10" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">benches</em>).
Equity terms as proportions of prompts—<em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.11" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">wheelchair</em> (7.2% vs. 7.6%), <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.12" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">LGBTQ+</em> (0.7% vs. 1.1%), <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.13" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Indigenous</em> (0.0% vs. 1.4%), <em id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.14" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">metro</em> (4.7% vs. 7.3%).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Synthetic moderation experiment.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We sampled 50 flagged items per governance state and drew remediation times from an exponential distribution with means of 36 h (open), 12 h (curated), and 6 h (veto-enabled). Reported means and 95% CIs: <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="30.5\pm\pm 8.9\text{\,}\mathrm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>30.5</mn><mo>±</mo><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>8.9</mn></mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30.5\pm\pm 8.9\text{\,}\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="11.8\pm\pm 3.2\text{\,}\mathrm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>11.8</mn><mo>±</mo><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>3.2</mn></mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">11.8\pm\pm 3.2\text{\,}\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5.6\pm\pm 1.5\text{\,}\mathrm{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5.6</mn><mo>±</mo><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5.6\pm\pm 1.5\text{\,}\mathrm{h}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Public checklist used in curation</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Locale specified; jargon avoided; max 60 words; no PII.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Value claim selected from controlled vocabulary (with free-text justification).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Accessibility tags present where relevant (mobility, vision, neurodiversity).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Safety and inclusion: avoid targeted exclusion; no hate speech.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At least one counter-prompt exists (opposing value claim) for deliberation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Licence attached (CC BY or CC BY–SA).</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
